                  {
                    "value": "5 \u00b7 Working Capital & UFCF \u2014 from scratch",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Profit is not cash, because of timing: customers pay later (AR), inventory is bought before it sells, suppliers are paid later (AP). Net working capital is the money trapped in that gap: NWC = AR + inventory + other op CA \u2212 AP \u2212 other op CL = 165.0 + 113.0 \u2212 118.5 = 159.5.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Growing the business widens the gap, so the CHANGE uses cash: \u0394NWC = 159.5 \u2212 133.2 = +26.3 this year.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Free cash is what the operation generates after reinvestment, before any financing: UFCF = NOPAT + D&A \u2212 capex \u2212 \u0394NWC = 186.5 + 66.2 \u2212 70.0 \u2212 26.3 = 156.4 ($156.35M exactly).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "\u2192 tab 1, walk section; bridge to levered FCF on tab 8",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
